---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Why Intimar exists and how our tantra retreats are held."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-widest text-brand-500 uppercase">
      About
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-serif text-3xl text-brand-900 sm:text-4xl">
      A small circle, held on purpose
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-p:text-brand-700 mt-8 max-w-none space-y-5">
      <p>
        Intimar started with a simple observation: tantra asks for presence, and
        presence doesn't scale. Add enough rooms, enough guests, enough
        subcontracted staff, and the thing that made a retreat work — a small
        group and a guide who actually knows your name — disappears.
      </p>
      <p>
        We hold a deliberately small number of retreats each year. Every one of
        them is led in person by our own guides, not a rotating cast of
        freelancers. That's why you'll see the same handful of faces across our
        retreat pages — we'd rather hold fewer gatherings well than scale into
        something we can't stand behind.
      </p>
      <p>
        If that sounds like your kind of gathering, take a look at our <a
          href="/events"
          class="text-brand-800 underline underline-offset-2"
          >upcoming retreats</a
        >
        or get to know the <a
          href="/team"
          class="text-brand-800 underline underline-offset-2"
          >guides leading them</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
